<BaseLayout title="Differential Equation Visualizer">
  <section class="prose max-w-none">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">
      Differential Equation Visualizer
    </h1>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">
      Project Description
    </h2>

    <p>
      This interactive application is a graphing calculator designed to
      visualize functions and numerically solve ordinary differential
      equations. Users can input equations of any form using an on-screen
      mathematical keypad, specify a solution range and initial conditions,
      and instantly generate the corresponding graph.
    </p>

    <p>
      The calculator supports explicit equations as well as first- and
      second-order differential equations, with numerical solutions computed
      using SciPy's <code>odeint</code> solver and symbolic manipulation
      handled through SymPy. It also includes trigonometric and logarithmic
      functions, arbitrary powers, absolute values, unit-step functions, and
      an approximation of the Dirac delta function. First-order differential
      equations can additionally be visualized with a slope field alongside
      the numerical solution.
    </p>

    <p>
      To make the tool practical for experimentation, the interface
      automatically replots solutions when the range or initial conditions
      are changed and maintains a history of previously graphed equations.
      The project was originally developed as a Tkinter desktop application
      and was redesigned in Streamlit so it could be embedded directly here.
    </p>

    <!-- Streamlit App -->
    <div class="w-full mt-6 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-base-300">
      <iframe
        src="https://diffeqcalculator.streamlit.app/?embed=true"
        title="Differential Equation Visualizer"
        width="100%"
        height="900"
        style="border: 0; display: block;"
        allow="clipboard-read; clipboard-write"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center text-sm opacity-70 mt-2">
      Embedded app taking a while to load?
